# This demo requires NO environment variables to run — `npm install && npm run dev` is enough.
#
# Everything below is documentation only: the variables a real backend
# (see docs/ARCHITECTURE.md and docs/API_SPEC.md) would introduce. None of
# these are read by any code in this repository today.

# --- Real backend (proposed, not implemented) ---
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:password@localhost:5432/freelancepilot
# JWT_SECRET=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000/api/v1

# --- AI service (proposed, not implemented) ---
# LLM_PROVIDER_API_KEY=
# TRANSLATION_PROVIDER_API_KEY=

# --- Notifications (proposed, not implemented) ---
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
# SENDGRID_API_KEY=
